      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rising_Fawn%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "World War II hero Desmond Doss, Medal of Honor recipient, lived in Rising Fawn for most of his life after the war.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
